~ start
Brother Do: [#dynamic_portrait=BrotherDoPortrait]Wassup brother, come to play my carnival game?
- Can I ask about the rules first?
	Brother Do: Sure, here are the rules.
	~ explain_rule
	Brother Do: [do portrait_with_part.assign_part(true)] Rule 1: Use WASD to move.
	Brother Do: [do portrait_with_part.assign_part(false)] Rule 2:  Wrong movement minus point.
	Brother Do: [do portrait_with_part.assign_part(true)] Rule 3: Ball goes right direction.
	Brother Do: You got it? Wanna play now?
	- Can you repeat again?
		Brother Do: Haizzz.. Ok listen carefully now!
		=> explain_rule
	- I got the rule, let me play.
		=> play_game
	- Yeah, but I dont wanna play anymore.
		Brother Do: Ok bro.
		Brother Do: Anyway my dude, there is this guy come here and waste my time...
		=> END
- Yes, please!
	~ play_game
	Brother Do: Ok i will setup the game now. Let's play!
	
=> END